# Figure build products: figures.py writes a 300dpi LZW-TIFF beside each PNG for
# the publisher's artwork requirements. The PNG is the canonical form and is
# committed; the TIFF is regenerated on every run, so ignore it to keep a clean
# clone clean after a reproduction run.
paper_a/figures/*.tiff

# NOTE: paper_a/data/ and paper_a/results/ are intentionally NOT ignored —
# they are committed so figures and metrics can be reproduced/checked without
# re-running the (overnight) simulation. Do not add them here.
